  "loopModel": "The fixed 4x4 vertex graph has 24 unit edges and 16 unique physical pipe IDs. Every numeric region clue counts its four boundary segments exactly; an interior edge counts once for both adjacent regions and null explicitly means no clue. A single nonempty connected cycle must cover all tree vertices, touch no forbidden flower vertex and satisfy all numeric clues. Spare pipe stock is allowed. A-on-edge places or removes one exact pipe, B restores the most recent successful edit without refunding time/errors/lifetime counts, and PUMP requires an explicit action. Three wrong starts or the active 90-second deadline end a round; this is a discrete graph puzzle, not a fluid simulation.",
